        <activityName xml:lang="en">Polycarboxylates, 40% active substance, at plant</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Polycarboxylates, 40% active substance, at plant
The data are based on site specific data, used for a EMPA study.;
UUID: f5a22e0a-f55b-3639-86b9-85f999ea7c81
This module contains material and energy input for the production of polycarboxylates out of acrylic acid and maleic anhydride. Transport and infrastructure have been estimated. No process emissions are accounted for.
Location: &lt;null&gt;
Technology: Co-polymerization process of maleic anhydride and acrylic acid
Time period: data of used literature
Production volume: na
Sampling: literature (data from one single producer) 
Extrapolations: see IncludedProcesses
Uncertainty adjustments: none
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_f5a22e0a-f55b-3639-86b9-85f999ea7c81.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
